Dashboard
Overview of monthly income, collections, overdue bills, and active tenants
Recent activity feed and overdue invoice alerts
Property Management
Add and manage multiple rental properties
Track unit counts and addresses
Tenant Management
Add/edit/delete tenants with full details — name, phone, email, room number, move-in date, rent amount, security deposit, and notes
Search and filter tenants by name or status (active/inactive)
Billing & Invoices
Auto-generate monthly rent invoices for all active tenants at once
Create invoices manually for individual tenants
Add extra charges per invoice: electricity, water, maintenance, parking, internet, late fees, and custom charges
Automatic invoice numbering (e.g. INV-202606-0001)
Payment Tracking
Record payments against invoices with method (UPI, cash, bank transfer, cheque) and transaction reference
Invoice status auto-updates to Paid / Partially Paid / Unpaid / Overdue
PDF & Sharing
Print any invoice as a PDF via the browser's print dialog
Share invoices via WhatsApp or any installed sharing app
Reset Tools
Clear all data to zero (empty start)
Restore sample data (demo tenants, invoices, payments)
Tech stack
Layer	Technology
Frontend	React + Vite, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui
Backend	Node.js + Express 5
Database	PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM
API	OpenAPI spec with auto-generated hooks
Currency	Indian Rupees (₹) throughout
